# SmartBugs results. Anchored to this directory on purpose: the unanchored
# "results*" also matched the source file sb/results2csv.py, which then never
# reached a commit.
# Since 2026-09-25 only two files per task are versioned (result.json and
# smartbugs.json, about 16 MB in total): they carry every number the
# evaluations under ../eval/ are built from. Logs, archives, SARIF and the
# console logs under results/logs/ stay out of git; the complete raw data are
# attached to a GitHub release of this repository (see ../README.md, section
# "Wo die Ergebnisse liegen").
/results/**
!/results/**/
!/results/**/result.json
!/results/**/smartbugs.json

# Default remote datasets
dataset/solidiFI

# Build and distribution
*.spec
*.manifest
